# Cloudflare Pages response headers. frame-ancestors lets Ikirmikir (and its previews, and local development) show the game.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors https://ikirmikir.com https://ikirmikir.pages.dev https://*.ikirmikir.pages.dev http://localhost:3000 http://127.0.0.1:3000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
